CloudBot container packaging
============================

This repository packages CloudBot, which is licensed under the GNU General
Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version
(GPL-3.0-or-later).

The complete upstream CloudBot source corresponding to the pinned release is
retained in every image at:

    /usr/src/cloudbot

That source tree includes the upstream GPL license text. The pinned source for
this release is:

    https://github.com/TotallyNotRobots/CloudBot
    release: v1.4.0
    commit: d891d49254d5c95ddd997c0d44e03a502966ba34

A canonical copy of GNU GPL version 3 is also available from the Free Software
Foundation at:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

See NOTICE for attribution and packaging details.
